      "content": "<h2><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Challenges Faced by Single Women in Finding Rentals</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc5xx3j9hrutjj\",\"id\":\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\"> </span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc5xx3j9hrutjj\",\"id\":\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\"> <br></span></h2><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Discrimination and Biases</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocm6hsibrsjyhw\",\"id\":\"toc_cvml8va8o33t\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_cvml8va8o33t\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocm6hsibrsjyhw\",\"id\":\"toc_cvml8va8o33t\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_cvml8va8o33t\"> </span></b></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Most landlords favor families rather than solo tenants, making the search cumbersome.</span></p><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>High Demand and Competitive Pricing</b></span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocw4h0moqo13p1\",\"id\":\"toc_pgf640t31fjw\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_pgf640t31fjw\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocw4h0moqo13p1\",\"id\":\"toc_pgf640t31fjw\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_pgf640t31fjw\"> </span></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Due to Sarjapur's popularity, demand has increased, making rentals more expensive</span></p><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Navigating Brokers and Online Platforms</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2ragr4welu1w\",\"id\":\"toc_6j7hd8legadn\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_6j7hd8legadn\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2ragr4welu1w\",\"id\":\"toc_6j7hd8legadn\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_6j7hd8legadn\"> </span></b></p><p><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc5xx3j9hrutjj\",\"id\":\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Brokers may be useful, but their charges can increase the expense. Websites such as<b> 99acres and MagicBricks</b> are excellent options.<br></span></span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 14.94pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Legal and Safety Considerations</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocc8l3gokkm1ba\",\"id\":\"toc_ff9u50vhncxe\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ff9u50vhncxe\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocc8l3gokkm1ba\",\"id\":\"toc_ff9u50vhncxe\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ff9u50vhncxe\"> </span></b></h2><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Importance of Rental Agreements</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toctjjj7jkae5ck\",\"id\":\"toc_035aacnwmjeb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_035aacnwmjeb\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toctjjj7jkae5ck\",\"id\":\"toc_035aacnwmjeb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_035aacnwmjeb\"> </span></b></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Make sure that the <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/blog/rental-agreement-its-types-and-its-benefits\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">rental agreement</a> has every term and condition so that any future discord is avoided.</span></p><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Verifying Landlord and Property Credentials</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tock03ypzwysw5z\",\"id\":\"toc_bk104jnvpiry\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_bk104jnvpiry\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tock03ypzwysw5z\",\"id\":\"toc_bk104jnvpiry\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_bk104jnvpiry\"> </span></b></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Always ensure the landlord's identity and the legal status of the property.</span></p><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Safety Tips for Single Women</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocr4l5sqqf8dui\",\"id\":\"toc_in2nspj6n8lt\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_in2nspj6n8lt\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocr4l5sqqf8dui\",\"id\":\"toc_in2nspj6n8lt\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_in2nspj6n8lt\"> </span></b></p><p><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc5xx3j9hrutjj\",\"id\":\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Install secondary locks and security devices.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"></span></p><p><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc5xx3j9hrutjj\",\"id\":\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Send your location to your trusted family or friends.<br></span></span></p><p></p><h2><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc5xx3j9hrutjj\",\"id\":\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Popular Platforms for Finding Houses</b>: </span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocjgxr1ldagcgz\",\"id\":\"toc_lxp1nx51h229\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_lxp1nx51h229\"> <br></span></span></span></h2><p><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc5xx3j9hrutjj\",\"id\":\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocjgxr1ldagcgz\",\"id\":\"toc_lxp1nx51h229\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_lxp1nx51h229\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br></span></span></span></span></p><h3><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc5xx3j9hrutjj\",\"id\":\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocjgxr1ldagcgz\",\"id\":\"toc_lxp1nx51h229\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_lxp1nx51h229\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>KOTS</b></span></span></span></span></h3><h2><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc5xx3j9hrutjj\",\"id\":\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_k618hrv9xi8f\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocjgxr1ldagcgz\",\"id\":\"toc_lxp1nx51h229\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_lxp1nx51h229\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">                        Available Flats in Kots</span></span></span></span></h2><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
