      "content": "<h3><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"></span></h3><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000956049\" data-doc-type=\"writer\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/sarjapur/1-bhk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a></span><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/sarjapur/1-bhk\" target=\"_blank\">Show Flats&nbsp;</a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/sarjapur/2-bhk\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">Show Flats</a>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><a href=\"https://www.nobroker.in/flats-for-rent-in-sarjapur_bangalore\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/sarjapur/3-bhk\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">Show Flats</a></span></p><h3><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br>Step-by-Step Process for Finding a Rental in Sarjapur:</span></h3><ul><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Visit <b>www.kots.world</b>.</span></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Use search tool to look up your locality (e.g., Sarjapur).</span></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span>Apply filters to determine your budget and the locality you are looking for.</li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span>Browse through listings that suit you the best.</li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span>Click on the listing for additional information, photos, and virtual tours.</li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span>If you would like to learn more, contact the agent through the site<br><br></li></ul><h3></h3><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Probability of Finding a Flat with Kots&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></h3>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p></p><p></p><h2><span id=\"input-sentence~0\" classification=\"HUMAN\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><b>Alternative Platforms</b></span></h2><br>Websites like <b>MagicBricks, 99acres, and NoBroker</b> are decent places to look for Sarjapur flats on rent. All these websites have detailed listings with budget, amenities, and location filters. While MagicBricks and 99acres lead you to agents or owners, NoBroker allows you to communicate with property owners directly at no brokerage.<br><h3><br></h3><p></p><p></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-for-rent-in-sarjapur-road-bangalore-pppfr\" target=\"_blank\">Show Flats</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.99acres.com/flats-for-rent-in-sarjapur-road-bangalore-east-ffid\" target=\"_blank\">Show Flats</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.nobroker.in/flats-for-rent-in-sarjapur_bangalore\" target=\"_blank\">Show Flats</a></p><h2><b><br>Magic Bricks</b></h2><h3><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br>Step-by-Step Process for Finding a Rental in Sarjapur:</span></h3><ul><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Visit <b>www.magicbrick.com</b><br></span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Go to \"<b>Rent</b>\" tab.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Enter \"<b>Sarjapur</b>\" as location.</li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Choose \"<b>Flat</b>\" as property type.</li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Optional: enter your budget.</li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Click on \"Search\"- listed flats for rent will be shown.<br><br></li></ul><h3><p style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2