      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h2><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>99acres</b></span></h2><h3><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br>Step-by-Step Process to Search for a Rental Flat in Sarjapur on 99acres:</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocdcbrdxdyl3ld\",\"id\":\"toc_hf85zcy4qc1y\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_hf85zcy4qc1y\">&nbsp;<br></span></span></h3><ul><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Visit <b>99acres </b>website.<br></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Click on the \"<b>Rent</b>\" tab.</li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Choose property type as flat.<br></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Enter \"<b>Sarjapur</b>\" or the locality.<br></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Define budget with filter range of ₹10,000 - ₹80,000.<br></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Apply filters to BHK, furnish, and amenities.<br></li><li style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Click on Search in order to be promoted.<br></li></ul><h3 style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Probability of Finding a Flat with 99 Acres:</span></h3>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p></p><h2><b>NoBroker</b></h2><p></p><h3><br>Step-by-step process for searching for a rental flat in Sarjapur using NoBroker:</h3><ul><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Please log in to <b>NoBroker</b> and search for \"<b>Sarjapur.</b>\"<br></span></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Use the filters (budget, type of flat, etc.)<br></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">View the listings along with the details.<br></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Approve the owners for queries or site visits.<br></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Visit, negotiate, and sanitize the rental agreement.<br></li></ul><h3><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">&nbsp;Probability of Finding a flat with No Broker:</span></p></h3><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h2><b><br>How to Improve Your Success Rate in Finding a Rental Flat in Sarjapur:</b></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Since listings are expired, and some owners never take them down, do the following to have a better shot:</span></p><ul><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Fresh Listings First</b></span><br class=\"zw-br\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Use only fresh postings or those with few reviews.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"><br class=\"zw-br\"></li><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Call Rather Than Messaging</b></span><br class=\"zw-br\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Calling receives extremely quick responses, and anyway, if a flat is let out ask them for the same.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"><br class=\"zw-br\"></li><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Contact More Owners and Brokers</b></span><br class=\"zw-br\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Call as many owners (at least 10) and on other websites.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"><br class=\"zw-br\"></li><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Managed Properties</b></span><br class=\"zw-br\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The inventories would have been kept current by the property managers like KOTS, hence ensuring perfect availability.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"><br class=\"zw-br\"></li><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Visit In Person for Faster Deals</b></span><br class=\"zw-br\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Arrive on time, and visit the properties in person.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"><br class=\"zw-br\"></li><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Negotiate Sensibly</b></span><br class=\"zw-br\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Provide token advance and demand more benefits like extra-time for movability or rent reduction.</span></li></ul><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc9y55u3d7q5tk\",\"id\":\"toc_eitwu34ioxmh\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_eitwu34ioxmh\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc9y55u3d7q5tk\",\"id\":\"toc_eitwu34ioxmh\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_eitwu34ioxmh\">&nbsp;</span></p><h2 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><b>Things to Consider After Finalizing a Rental House</b></h2><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"18pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.6\" style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Budget:</b> Your income is proportionate to your rent.</span></p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"18pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.6\" style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Legal:</b> Verify title deeds, agreements, and contracts.</span></p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"18pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.6\" style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Neighborhood: </b>Ensure that it is safe, near work, school, and is child-friendly.</span></p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"18pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.6\" style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Size and House Layout:</b> Keep the room as well as affordability in mind.</span></p><h3 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Pricing and Budget Considerations:</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" geo_transformation\":{\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false,\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false}},\"name\":\"_toc0nnbtly3jrfk\",\"id\":\"toc_tmzm8njw8p0u\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_tmzm8njw8p0u\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc0nnbtly3jrfk\",\"id\":\"toc_tmzm8njw8p0u\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_tmzm8njw8p0u\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocbwg1b2488rpa\",\"id\":\"toc_8k1um10gkt7e\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_8k1um10gkt7e\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocbwg1b2488rpa\",\"id\":\"toc_8k1um10gkt7e\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_8k1um10gkt7e\">&nbsp;</span></b></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\">The average rental and purchase prices in Bellandur vary depending on proximity to all major areas and facilities.</p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0in\" data-text-indent=\"0in\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"></p><p>Prices differ depending on house types and location.</p><br class=\"zw-br\"><p></p><h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>How to Narrow Down Your Search:</b></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Use filters by price, place, and amenities. Slowly turn on your key requirements like travel time and security of the area. Ultimately, view the properties yourself in order to get to know more about the locality.<br><br></span></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000962014\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"></p><h2><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>FAQS</b></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Q.How many kilometers from Sarjapur to Majestic?</span></p><p>The road distance from Sarjapur to Majestic is approximately 20-22 kilometers, depending upon traffic. The journey by road from Sarjapur to Majestic takes about 45 minutes to 1 hour.</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Q.How far is Sarjapur from KIA (Kempegowda International Airport)?</span></p><p>Sarjapur is approximately 40-45 kilometers from Kempegowda International Airport (KIA). The journey takes approximately 1 hour to 1.5 hours depending on traffic and the route taken.</p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Q.How do I get to Sarjapur from Majestic using public transport?</span></p><p>You can use a BMTC bus from Majestic to Sarjapur. The journey usually takes between 45 minutes to 1 hour, depending on traffic and the route taken.<br></p><p><span id=\"input-sentence~0\" classification=\"HUMAN\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Q.What are the top tech parks close to Sarjapur?</span></p><p><span id=\"input-sentence~0\" classification=\"HUMAN\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Sarjapur is in good proximity to some of Bangalore's top tech parks, which include:<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></span></p><ul><li><span id=\"input-sentence~0\" classification=\"HUMAN\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Cessna Business Park (about 10-12 km)</span></li><li><span id=\"input-sentence~0\" classification=\"HUMAN\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Kormanahalli Tech Park (about 15 km)<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></span></li><li><span id=\"input-sentence~0\" classification=\"HUMAN\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">EcoSpace (about 12-15 km)<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"></span></li><li><span id=\"input-sentence~0\" classification=\"HUMAN\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">ITPL (International Tech Park Bangalore), about 20-22 km.</span></li></ul><p></p><p></p>",
